        {
          "text": "I had survived physical therapy, phantom pain, funerals, overdue mortgage notices, and a dairy cow kicking a gate clean ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 168
        },
        {
          "text": "But Willow Creek had a way of making a person feel seen even when they desperately wanted to disappear",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 443
        }
