      "words": 67
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I put on makeup for this.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2395
        },
        {
          "text": "“That’s your argument?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2438
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yes.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2459
        },
        {
          "text": "“Not very strong. You put makeup on every day.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2464
        },
        {
          "text": "“Don’t question me, young lady.” Her hand slipped through my arm as we climbed the town hall steps. The contact was ligh",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2510
        },
        {
          "text": "For five years, I had assumed I was protecting her by keeping us out of town traditions that reminded us of Pops",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2754
        },
        {
          "text": "Maybe I had been protecting myself",
          "ok": true,
