    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Oh, Evelyn,” she whispered. Meme held onto her longer than I expected. When they finally separated, Margaret said, “I s",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5207
        },
        {
          "text": "“We both should’ve called.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5345
        },
        {
          "text": "Grief made people promise to stay close. Life made them forget",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5433
        },
        {
          "text": "“Evie.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5735
        },
        {
          "text": "Meme’s mouth trembled. “Walt.” Her broken voice was somehow worse than his",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5741
        },
        {
          "text": "Walter released her. “I missed you too.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6034
        }
      ],
