      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Emotional support.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6294
        },
        {
          "text": "I turned the soft bread over to read the label. Pumpkin. “I didn’t ask for emotional support.” Though, it was a welcome ",
          "ok": true,
