        },
        {
          "text": "Hunter leaned slightly toward me. “It’s easier to accept it.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6554
        },
        {
          "text": "I understood immediately why Clover had been the person to reach Hunter when the rest of Willow Creek apparently hadn’t ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6863
        }
      ],
      "words": 60
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "This was what I had forgotten. Not the pumpkins. Not the lights. The people. Willow Creek never did anything simply. A f",
